ORDINANCE II OF 1979
ORDINANCE II OF 1979
BALUCHISTAN STUDENTS WELFARE FUND ORDINANCE, 1979
2. Definitions.‑‑In this Ordinance, unless there is
anything repugnant in the subject or context,‑
(a) "Board" means the
Provincial Board constituted by the Government under this Ordinance
(b) "Chairman" means
the Chairman of the Board ;
(c) "Fund" means the
funds created under this Ordinance ;
(d) "Government" means the Government of Baluchistan ;
(el "Local Fund Audit" means the Local Fund Audit as
provided in the Baluchistan Local Government Act, 1975 ;
(f) "Member" means
the member of the Board ;
(g) "Ordinance" means
the Baluchistan Students Welfare Fund Ordi nance, 1979 ;
(h) "Rules" means the
rules framed under the provisions of this Ordinance ;
(i) "Student" means a
student studying in a Scbool/College/University run by the Government. .
